  "zhTitle": "GetResourceLimits",
  "summary": "Admin API Protobuf 操作参考：GetResourceLimits。",
  "body": "<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-page x2mdx-ref-page--操作\" />\n\n<div className=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-shell\">\n  <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-main\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumbs\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n      <span>参与者管理</span>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <a href=\"../../../index\">Protobuf</a>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <a href=\"../../../packages/com-digitalasset-canton-admin-参与方-v30\">com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30</a>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <span>获取资源限制</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-hero\">\n      <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-eyebrow\">com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30</p>\n\n      <h1 class=\"x2mdx-ref-title\">获取资源限制</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">gRPC</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4.0 起</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-bar\">\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-method x2mdx-ref-operation-method--rpc\">RPC</span>\n\n      <code>/com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.ResourceManagementService/GetResourceLimits</code>\n    </div>\n\n    ## 协议详细信息\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>协议</dt>\n        <dd>gRPC</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>服务</dt>\n        <dd>资源管理服务</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>RPC</dt>\n        <dd>获取资源限制</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>客户端流</dt>\n        <dd>否</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>服务器流</dt>\n        <dd>否</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n\n    ## 输入\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel-head\">\n        <h3>获取资源限制请求</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n          <dt>消息</dt>\n          <dd>com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.GetResourceLimitsRequest</dd>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n          <dt>客户端流</dt>\n          <dd>否</dd>\n        </div>\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n\n    ## 输出\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel-head\">\n        <h3>获取资源限制响应</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n          <dt>消息</dt>\n          <dd>com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.GetResourceLimitsResponse</dd>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n          <dt>服务器流</dt>\n          <dd>否</dd>\n        </div>\n      </dl>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-fields\">\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n          <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n            <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">当前\\_限制</code>\n            <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">资源限制</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    ## 生命周期变化\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-change-list\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-change-item\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-change-version\">3.4.0</span>\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-change-detail\">引入</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    ## 相关模式\n\n    <手风琴组>\n      <手风琴标题=“com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.GetResourceLimitsRequest”>\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema\" id=\"schema-com-digitalasset-canton-admin-参与方-v30-getresourcelimitsrequest\" />\n      </手风琴>\n\n      <手风琴标题=“com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.GetResourceLimitsResponse”>\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema\" id=\"schema-com-digitalasset-canton-admin-参与方-v30-getresourcelimitsresponse\">\n          <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-fields\">\n            <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n              <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n                <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">当前\\_限制</code>\n                <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">资源限制</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </手风琴><手风琴标题=“com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.ResourceLimits”>\n        <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-schema\" id=\"schema-com-digitalasset-canton-admin-参与方-v30-resourcelimits\">\n          <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-fields\">\n            <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n              <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n                <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">max\\_inflight\\_validation\\_requests</code>\n                <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">uint32</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n              <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n                <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">最大\\_提交\\_率</code>\n                <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">uint32</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-row\">\n              <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-main\">\n                <code class=\"x2mdx-ref-field-name\">max\\_submission\\_burst\\_factor</code>\n                <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-type-badge\">双</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </手风琴>\n    </手风琴组>\n  </div>\n\n  <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-right-rail\" role=\"complementary\" aria-label=\"示例和响应\">\n    <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-panel\">\n      <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-code\">\n        <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-head\">\n          <span className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-heading\">grpcurl</span>\n        </div>\n\n        ```bash grpcurl theme={\"theme\":{\"light\":\"github-light\",\"dark\":\"github-dark\"}}\n        # Add -plaintext if the server is not using TLS.\n        grpcurl \\\n          -d @ \\\n          <HOST:PORT> \\\n          com.digitalasset.canton.admin.参与方.v30.ResourceManagementService/GetResourceLimits <<'EOF'\n        {}\n        EOF\n        ```\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-panel\">\n      <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-code x2mdx-ref-rail-code--response\">\n        <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-head\">\n          <span className=\"x2mdx-ref-rail-heading\">确定</span>\n\n          <span className=\"x2mdx-ref-response-label\">application/json</span>\n        </div>\n\n        ```json OK theme={\"theme\":{\"light\":\"github-light\",\"dark\":\"github-dark\"}}\n        {\n          \"currentLimits\": {\n            \"maxInflightValidationRequests\": 0,\n            \"maxSubmissionRate\": 0,\n            \"maxSubmissionBurstFactor\": 0.0\n          }\n        }\n        ```\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
